{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"卷九百四十◎鱗介部十二","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○琼魚","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《漢武內傳》曰：西王母曰：\"仙人上藥，有流淵琼魚。\"","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○橫公魚","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《神異經》曰：北方荒外有石湖，其中有橫公魚，長七八尺，形状如鳢而目赤。晝則在湖中，夜化為人。刺之不入，煮之不世，以乌梅二七煮之乃熟。食之可以止邪病。(《玄黃經》曰：橫公魚不可殺，惟加乌梅其氣乃滅。)","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○發魚","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《魏武四時食製》曰：發魚，帶發如婦人，白肥，無鱗，出滇池。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○蒲魚","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《魏武四時食製》曰：蒲魚，其鱗如粥，出郫縣。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○印魚","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海異物志》曰：印魚，無鱗，形似〈魚昔〉(音错。)形，額上四方如印，有文章。諸大魚應死者，印魚先封之。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"郭延之《述征記》曰：城陽縣南量蕊，尧母慶都墓廟前一池，魚額間有印文，名頰魚。非告祠者，捕不可得。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"左思《吳都賦》曰：印龟鱕(音藩。)〈魚昔〉。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○黃魚","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《吳書》曰：薛綜上疏：\"交州刺史朱符多以乡人分作長史，強賦民黃魚一枚、稻一斛。\"","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"劉欣期《交州記》曰：武寧縣秋九月，黃魚上化作鶉鳥。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《南方草物状》曰：短細黃魚，九月中，因秋風而变成鶉，上团，吏捕取炙食，滋味肥美。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《南中八郡志》曰：江出黃魚，魚形頗似鳣，骨如葱，可食。","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"郭義恭《廣志》曰：揵為郡僰道縣出臑骨黃魚。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○寄魚","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"沉懷遠《南越志》曰：寄魚，長三寸，似白魚，常附海舡以濟洪波。一曰寄載魚。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：寄度魚，長三寸，似白魚。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○君魚","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"沉懷遠《南越志》曰：君魚，長三寸，背上骨如筆管，大者似矛。逢諸細魚及黿，腹皆斷之。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○琵琶魚","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海異物志》曰：琵琶魚，無鱗，形如琵琶。","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"沉懷遠《南越志》曰：琵琶魚，無鱗，長二尺，形似琵琶，故因以為名。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"任昉《述異記》曰：海魚千歲為劍魚。樂魚，一名琵琶魚，形似琵琶而喜鳴，因以為名。","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"左思《吳都賦》曰：鲛鲻琵琶。","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"曹毗《楊都賦》曰：魚則琵琶、乌賊。","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○疏齒魚","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《魏武四時食製》曰：疏齒魚，味如猪魚，出東海。","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"潘嶽《沧海賦》曰：比目、疏齒。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○班魚","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《魏武四時食製》曰：班魚，頭中有石如珠，出北海。","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"郭義恭《廣志》曰：班魚，頭中有玉石，如珠璣。","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○黃雀魚","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海異物志》曰：黃雀魚，常以八月化為黃雀，到十月入海為魚。","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《風土記》曰：六月，東南長風，俗名黃雀風，時海魚化為黃雀，因為名也。","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○燕魚","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海異物志》曰：燕魚，長五寸，陰雨起飛高丈餘。","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○鳶魚","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海異物志》曰：鳶魚，状如鳶，惟無尾足。陰雨日亦飛高數丈。","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○赤魚","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"魚豢《魏略》曰：文帝欲受禪，赤魚遊於露镬。","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○玄魚","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《王子年拾遺錄》曰：夏鯀理水無功，沉於羽川，化為玄魚，大千尺。後遂死，橫於河海之間。後世聖人以玄魚為神化之物，以\"玄\"种合於\"魚\"种為\"鮌\"种。","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○邵魚","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：邵魚，状如鳶魚。","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○鱬(而朱切)鰗魚","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：鱬鰗魚，状如鳶魚形。","sortOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○井魚","sortOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海異物志》曰：井魚，頭有兩角。","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○鏡魚","sortOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海異物志》曰：鏡魚，如鏡，形體薄，少肉。","sortOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○含光魚","sortOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海異物志》曰：含光魚，一名蠟魚。黃而美，故謂之蠟，有光照燭。","sortOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"沉懷遠《南越志》曰：含光謂蠟魚，正黃而美，故謂為蠟魚，夜則有光。","sortOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《嶺表錄異》曰：黃蠟魚，即江湖之橫魚，頭嘴長，而鱗背金色。南人脔為炙，雖美而毒，或煎爆或乾。夜即有光如燭。","sortOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○〈魚辰〉魚","sortOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海異物志》曰：〈魚辰〉魚，如指，長七八寸，但有脊骨，好作羹。大者如竹竿，曝作燭，極有光明。","sortOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○{宛魚}魚","sortOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海異物記》曰：{宛魚}魚，三月生溪中，裁長一寸。至十月中，東還死於海，香氣聞於水上。到時月辄复更生。","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《永嘉地記》曰：石堂水口多{宛魚}魚。","sortOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○吹沙魚","sortOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海異物志》曰：吹沙，長三寸，背上有刺，犯之螫人。","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○伏念魚","sortOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：伏念魚，似吹沙魚。","sortOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○金石魚","sortOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《南越記》曰：金石魚，形圓，如七寸盤。","sortOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○婢屣魚","sortOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海異物志》曰：婢屣魚，口近腹下，形似婦人屣。","sortOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○奴屩魚","sortOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：奴屩魚，長一尺，如屩形。","sortOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○{沃魚}(音沃)魚","sortOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：{沃魚}魚，似蒲魚，長三尺。","sortOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○銅哾魚","sortOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海異物志》曰：銅哾魚，長五寸，似鯈魚。","sortOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○陶魚","sortOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：陶魚，長三尺，似鱦(音繩。)魚。","sortOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○石班魚","sortOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：石班魚、媱虫、六虫為一。","sortOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_83","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"又曰：石班魚，媱虫。(蝘蝥也。{班魚}魚，長尺餘。其班如虎文，俗言蝘蝥。於瞬顛呼之，因走上岸，合牝，其子不可食也。)","sortOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_84","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○戴星魚","sortOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：戴星魚，状如鳶魚，背上有兩白璫如指大，因名之雲。","sortOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○〈魚党〉魚","sortOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"沉懷遠《南越南》曰：〈魚党〉魚，似〈魚夫〉〈魚畢〉。(音畢。)尾氏有刺，如欓树刺也。","sortOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○魿魚(音零)","sortOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：魿魚，似〈魚公〉魚。","sortOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_90","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《異物志》曰：南方魚多不肥美，惟魿魚為上。大者長二尺，作脍炙尤香而美。","sortOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《嶺表錄異》曰：魿魚，如白魚，而身稍短，尾不偃。清遠江多此魚，蓋不產於海也。廣人得之多為脍，不腥而美，諸魚尾馛過也。","sortOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○織杼魚","sortOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：織杼魚，状如蹓魚，味美於諸魚。","sortOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_94","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"沉懷遠《南越志》曰：織杼魚，如真魚，背上正青。","sortOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○〈魚隹〉鯺魚","sortOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土志》曰：〈魚隹〉鯺，形似〈魚隹〉魚，戲於重川，靡有定所。","sortOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○土奴魚","sortOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：土奴魚，頭如虎，有刺螫人。","sortOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○新婦魚","sortOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_100","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：新婦魚，似〈魚隹〉魚，長一丈。","sortOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○海犭希魚","sortOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：海犭希魚，豕頭，身長九尺。","sortOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"郭璞《江賦》曰：魚則江豚海犭希。","sortOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"曹毗《楊都賦》曰：海犭希鯨鱘。","sortOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○鯤鮑魚","sortOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：鯤鮑魚，似海印魚。","sortOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○潛遠魚","sortOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土志》曰：潛遠魚，似{沃魚}。(潛遠，魚名，似{沃魚}魚。)","sortOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○虾蟆魚","sortOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：虾蟆魚，色如鳶魚，頭似虾蟆，尾又似鳶。","sortOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○黿魚(音玄)","sortOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：黿魚，長五寸。","sortOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○鼠魚","sortOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"沉懷遠《南越志》曰：鼠魚，頭如鼠。","sortOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海異物志》曰：鼠魚，長七寸，頭如鼠。","sortOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○弓魚","sortOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：弓魚，長三寸，似鲵魚。","sortOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○〈魚婴〉〈魚壹〉魚","sortOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：〈魚婴〉〈魚壹〉魚，長一尺。","sortOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○黍魚","sortOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：黍魚，長三尺，似〈魚資〉{如魚}。","sortOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_122","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○〈魚仓〉(音仓)魚","sortOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：〈魚仓〉魚，兩肋下有大肉，如炙脔大。","sortOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《嶺表錄異》曰：〈魚仓〉魚，形似鯿魚，而腦上突起，連背而圓薯。肉甚厚，魚白如凝脂，只有一脊骨。治之以薑葱，炮之粳米，其骨亦软，餐者無所弃。鄙俚謂之狗磕睡魚。(以其犬在盤下難伺其骨，故雲狗磕睡魚也。)","sortOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_125","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○饋尾魚","sortOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_126","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《南越記》曰：饋尾魚，有毒，一名鱉魚。","sortOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_127","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○土拌魚","sortOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_128","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：土拌魚，長七寸，白黑班文。","sortOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○高魚","sortOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_130","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《異物志》曰：高魚，與鳟相似。與蜥蝪於水上相合，常以三二月中，有雌而無雄，食其胎殺人。","sortOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_131","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○芦〈魚孚〉(音孚)魚","sortOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《異物志》曰：芦〈魚孚〉，似鰍蝥而有細文，多膏，肥美，如大芦管。本出地中，隨泉浮出，俗名芦〈魚孚〉。","sortOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_133","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"沉懷遠《南越志》曰：芦〈魚孚〉魚生山曲水間，穴地為窟，泉源踴，則此魚出。今庐陵以南至於南州有焉。俗以為醬。","sortOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_134","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○鼍風魚","sortOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_135","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《異物志》曰：冬天，此魚數千萬頭共處大窟中藏，上有白氣。或在鼍穴中，皮黑如漆，能潛知數里中空木所在，因風而入空木，化為蝙蝠。其肉甚美。","sortOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_136","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○鯤魚","sortOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_137","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《毛詩·雞鳴》曰：弊笱在梁，其魚鲂、鯤。","sortOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_138","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《爾雅》曰：鯤，魚子。(凡魚之子，總名鯤。)","sortOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_139","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"又曰：鱦，小魚。(音繩。又音孕。匠箔東呼魚子未成者為繩也。)","sortOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_140","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○海鯤魚","sortOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_141","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《王子年拾遺錄》曰：黑河，北極也。其水浓黑不流，上有黑雲生焉。有黑鯤千尺，状如鯨，常飛遊往於南海。","sortOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《莊子》曰：北冥有魚，其名為鯤，其大不知幾千里。","sortOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_143","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"江逌詩曰：巨鰲戴蓬萊，大鯤運天地。倏忽雲雨興，俯仰三植慼。","sortOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_144","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"孫放《詠莊子詩》曰：巨細同一馬，物化無常歸。修鯤解長鱗，鵬起片雲飛。撫翼摶積風，仰凌垂天翚。","sortOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_145","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"袁弘《北征賦》曰：魚托水而成鯤，木在山而有松。","sortOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○鲕(音而)魚","sortOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《呂氏春秋》曰：魚之美者，東海之鲕。","sortOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_148","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"張衡《西京賦》曰：巢鯤鲕。(鯤，魚子也。鲕，細魚類也。)","sortOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○細赤魚","sortOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_150","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"劉義慶《幽明錄》曰：始興雲水源有湯泉。每至霜雪，其上蒸氣高數十丈。泉中常有細赤魚出遊，莫有獲者。","sortOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○鳏魚","sortOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_152","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《毛詩》曰：弊笱在梁，其魚鲂、鳏。(鳏夫魚也。)","sortOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《孔丛子》曰：衛人釣於河，得鳏，其大盈車。曰：\"吾下一鲂之餌，鳏過而不视。又以豚之半，則吞矣。\"鐘思曰：\"鳏貪以餌死，士貪以祿世。\"","sortOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_154","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○真魚","sortOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_155","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"沉懷遠《南越志》曰：真魚，如織杼魚。","sortOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_156","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：〈魚真〉魚，俗謂之猶魚。","sortOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_157","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○雞子魚","sortOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_158","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《嶺表錄異》曰：雞子魚，口有嘴，如雞，肉趐，無鱗，尾尖而長。有風涛即乘風飛於海上船，類鲐鯣魚。","sortOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_159","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○竹魚","sortOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_160","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《嶺表錄異》曰：竹魚，產江溪間，形如鳢魚，大而少骨，青黑色，鱗下間以朱點鬛，可玩。或烹以為羹臛，肥而美。","sortOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_161","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○乳穴魚","sortOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_162","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《嶺表錄異》曰：全義嶺之西南有盤龍山，山有乳洞，斜貫一溪，號為靈水溪。(今桂州靈川縣也。)溪內有魚，皆修尾，四足，丹其腹，遊泳自若。漁人不敢捕之。(《爾雅》雲：鲵似鮉，四足，聲如小兒啼。今商州山溪內亦有此魚，謂之魶魚。)","sortOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_163","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"○{勝魚}魚","sortOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_164","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《臨海水土記》曰：{勝魚}魚，似鱦魚，長二尺。","sortOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_940_165","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_940","text":"《太平御覽》　宋·李昉","sortOrder":165}],"overrides":{}}